# Proof: F-V3-PINCELL
# Top: v3_pin_cell
# Assumptions: Initial sampled reset; free-running timebase (now increments by 1
#   each cycle); arbitrary enable, commit, deadlines, pad input and clear.
# Properties: Never early, fires on time, exactly-due boundary, past-due applies
#   and flags, no overwrite, open-drain safety, release, missed stickiness, and
#   bounded liveness (an occupied slot is free within distance + 1 cycles).
# Method: temporal induction; bounded success alone is insufficient.
# Scope and abstractions: formal/README.md.

read_verilog -formal src/v3_pin_cell.v
prep -top v3_pin_cell
flatten
memory_map
opt
async2sync
dffunmap
sat -seq 5 -tempinduct -maxsteps 16 -set-assumes -prove-asserts -verify
